  "bodyHash": "i56CRqmg0qQ=",
  "content": "<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a5486d7e-3cb1-496b-bbaa-f90207d97319.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"384\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 關於星際大戰擴充</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">FazBrick Studios 團隊為您帶來星際大戰擴充模組。本模組持續維護並更新至最新的 Minecraft 版本，並完全支援多人遊戲。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">此專案致力於以動態且創新的方式，將星際大戰宇宙的廣大內容帶入 Minecraft。星際大戰擴充包含飛船、武器、敵人以及新的星球，將帶給您漫長的探索旅程，提供忠於盧卡斯影業宇宙的體驗，同時為 Minecraft 帶來全新的遊玩方式。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">本模組目前包含多樣化的武器與飛船，以及一顆可供探索並展開冒險的星球：塔圖因。這顆星球擁有不同的建築、地牢和村莊，以增強您在這個全新宇宙中的沉浸感。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">本模組目前處於早期開發階段，將持續更新，加入新內容並推進版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_be25769b-9750-4fb6-8b03-9d2897e6b75b.png\"></span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 我可以將其放入模組包嗎？</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">當然可以！請隨意將此模組加入您的模組包中。我們鼓勵您這麼做，只要記得標註來源即可。</span></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 星際大戰擴充特色</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">星際大戰擴充目前包含大量且完整的物品與建築清單，讓您能充分享受此體驗。</span>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">震動斧</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">震動刀</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">電擊棒</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">加德菲棍</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">DL-44 雷射槍</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">E-11 爆能槍</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">EE-3 步槍</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Westar-34 雷射槍</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>太空船：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">X-wing 戰機</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">鈦戰機</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">陸行艇</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">極速飛艇</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">逃生艙</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">AT-ST 步行機</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>建築：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">絕地神殿</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">破損的逃生艙</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">塔圖因村莊</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">塔斯肯營地</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">莫斯艾斯利</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">霍斯基地</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">伊娃克營地</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>機器人：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">宇航技工機器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">禮儀機器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">岡克機器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">老鼠機器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">T3-M4</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">BB-8</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">戰鬥機器人</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>星球：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">塔圖因</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">卡希克（尚未實裝）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">霍斯（開發中）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">恩多（尚未實裝）</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;入門指南</span></strong></h2><p><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">要開始您的冒險，您需要在主世界找到一個墜毀的逃生艙。您可以使用可合成出的修理套件來修復此艙，使其恢復完整功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c9cbfe4a-7774-4f6d-b14f-5e87b6e41c9b.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">修復完成後，您可以登上逃生艙，並透過銀河系星球選擇系統，前往星際大戰擴充提供的各個星球。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d17ce253-6598-409b-b3dc-fcd33ba857dc.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">抵達塔圖因後，您可以探索村莊進行交易，購買新的材料、物品和武器，同時收集資源，用於對抗成為您敵人的生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_16ac1909-4fbd-4fb7-b31a-6ca0a1f1a815.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您可以在這些村莊中使用在星球上收集的金屬和材料，購買機器人、武器和太空船。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67b5127b-e6e9-4fea-bee2-ed11ff6ef4b5.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">此外，您還可以在星球各處找到各種絕地神殿，在那裡鍛造您的光劍，並與原力合而為一。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_04b9a4e3-cd94-4aed-96b2-d9c94f7d8f7c.png\"></span></p><article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fEoL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349915/description_7f29ea59-4f42-4a40-9fd9-b9bb44b4ae29.png\"></a></p>\n<p>🌌 立即展開您的星際大戰旅程！透過 Nitrado 和 Apex Hosting 提供的一鍵伺服器安裝，您和您的朋友可以立刻沉浸在《星際大戰擴充》的史詩世界中！</p>\n<p>要開始，您只需要一個至少擁有 <strong>4GB 或更多 RAM</strong> 的 <strong>Minecraft Java 伺服器</strong>（建議用於多人遊戲時更順暢）。只需在您的控制面板上按一下，即可立即安裝 <strong>星際大戰擴充 [CurseForge]</strong>，今天就開始您的銀河冒險！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>也來試試官方的 After The Nukes 模組包吧！</strong></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/after-the-nukes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349915/description_7806c8ce-bc0b-4d5b-a726-eb2796eec020.png\" width=\"475\" height=\"438\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</article><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><h2><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;重新發布授權</strong></h2><p><strong>您不得在 Curseforge 或 Modrinth 以外的網站或域名上傳或重新發布此模組。</strong></p><p><strong>這特別包括 RU-Minecraft。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>需求</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Player Animator&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><strong>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/GeckoLib/bh_GL_trans.png\" width=\"158\" height=\"158\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><h6>此模組《星際大戰擴充》是一個獨立的粉絲專案，<strong>與</strong> Mojang、Lucasfilm Ltd.、The Walt Disney Company 或其任何附屬機構<strong>無關聯，也未獲得其背書或支援</strong>。<br>所有商標與版權皆屬於其各自所有者。<br>使用此類名稱與參考僅用於<strong>粉絲創作目的</strong>，並不代表任何關聯或背書。<br>《星際大戰》及所有相關財產為 Lucasfilm Ltd. 之商標。<br>本模組為<strong>非商業性粉絲創作</strong>，製作時尊重所有智慧財產權。</h6>",
